      "description": "Top panel shows Barack Obama in a formal suit and tie, speaking at a podium with a serious expression, gesturing with his right hand. He is depicted in a professional setting, likely a press conference or official address. The text overlay quotes him saying: 'those that attack one muslim, are attacking all muslims'. This is a recognizable public figure, and his image is used to represent a statement about religious tolerance.",
