      "@type": "Scene",
      "instance_name": "quote_juxtaposition_scene",
      "label": "juxtaposition_of_quotes",
      "description": "A scene that juxtaposes two panels: the top panel features Barack_Obama delivering a quote about Muslims, while the bottom panel features a cowboy image with a quote about Americans. The scene is structured to create a visual and conceptual contrast, implying a comparison or analogy between the two statements.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
